{
    "chapter_num": 6,
    "verses_count": 15,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Eighth Vision: Four Chariots"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And again I lifted my eyes and saw, and behold, four chariots came out from between two mountains; and the mountains were mountains of bronze. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The first chariot had red horses, the second black horses, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the third white horses, and the fourth chariot dappled gray"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Compare Gk: The meaning of the Hebrew word is uncertain"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " horses. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then I said to the angel who talked with me, “What are these, my lord?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the angel answered me, “These are going forth to the four winds of heaven, after presenting themselves before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of all the earth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The chariot with the black horses goes toward the north country, the white ones go toward the west country,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Cn: Heb after them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and the dappled ones go toward the south country.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When the steeds came out, they were impatient to get off and patrol the earth. And he said, “Go, patrol the earth.” So they patrolled the earth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he cried to me, “Behold, those who go toward the north country have set my Spirit at rest in the north country.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Coronation of the Branch"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came to me: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Take from the exiles Heldai, Tobi′jah, and Jedai′ah, who have arrived from Babylon; and go the same day to the house of Josi′ah, the son of Zephani′ah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Take from them silver and gold, and make a crown,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gk Mss: Heb crowns"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and set it upon the head of Joshua, the son of Jehoz′adak, the high priest; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and say to him, ‘Thus says the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts, “Behold, the man whose name is the Branch: for he shall grow up in his place, and he shall build the temple of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "It is he who shall build the temple of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", and shall bear royal honor, and shall sit and rule upon his throne. And there shall be a priest by his throne, and peaceful understanding shall be between them both.”’ "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the crown"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gk: Heb crowns"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " shall be in the temple of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as a reminder to Heldai,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "With verse 10: Heb Helem"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Tobi′jah, Jedai′ah, and Josi′ah"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "With verse 10: Heb Hen"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the son of Zephani′ah."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“And those who are far off shall come and help to build the temple of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "; and you shall know that the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts has sent me to you. And this shall come to pass, if you will diligently obey the voice of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your God.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}